### 6. Where `email` and `namesakeCount` come from on creation

- **email**: comes from the request body (`OwnerFieldsDto.getEmail()`), normalized/validated in the controller `addOwner`, **`OwnerRestControllerV1.java`** lines 150-153 and set at line 172 (`owner.setEmail(email)`). Normalizer: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/validation/EmailNormalizer.java`.
- **namesakeCount**: computed server-side in `ClinicServiceImpl.countNamesakes` (lines 279-283) and stamped in `saveOwner` (line 253) — counts existing owners sharing the same first+last name case-insensitively, via `ownerRepository.findByLastNameIgnoreCase`.

### Note on "tenure" and "level 4"
Neither "tenure" nor "level 4"/"level4" appears anywhere in the repository (main or test). The only capping reference is the test comment "capped 3" for the proposed numeric `membershipLevel` (max value 3).

